BT
/F2 22.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 788.00 Tm
(ACW Raspberry Pi Kiosk Setup Guide) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 760.00 Tm
(Follow this guide to make the Pi boot straight into the fullscreen slideshow.) Tj
/F1 8.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 744.00 Tm
() Tj
/F2 15.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 734.00 Tm
(1. Put the project on the Pi) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 713.00 Tm
(Clone or copy the repository to a stable location. The examples below assume:) Tj
/F3 10.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 697.00 Tm
(/opt/acw-screen-updater) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 683.00 Tm
(Then install the Python dependencies:) Tj
/F3 10.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 667.00 Tm
(cd /opt/acw-screen-updater) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 653.00 Tm
(python3 -m pip install -r requirements.txt) Tj
/F1 8.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 639.00 Tm
() Tj
/F2 15.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 629.00 Tm
(2. Test the app manually) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 608.00 Tm
(Run a refresh once, then start the local web app:) Tj
/F3 10.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 592.00 Tm
(python3 -m pi_display.refresh) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 578.00 Tm
(python3 -m pi_display.web) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 564.00 Tm
(Open these URLs on the Pi to confirm the dashboard and display are working:) Tj
1 0 0 1 70.00 548.00 Tm
(- http://localhost:8080/) Tj
1 0 0 1 70.00 532.00 Tm
(- http://localhost:8080/fullscreen.html?includeClasses=false) Tj
1 0 0 1 54.00 516.00 Tm
(Use the dashboard to upload a promo video and link it to an event. The fullscreen) Tj
1 0 0 1 54.00 500.00 Tm
(screen should then show the video first and the booking slide second.) Tj
/F1 8.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 484.00 Tm
() Tj
/F2 15.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 474.00 Tm
(3. Install the systemd services) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 453.00 Tm
(Copy these files from the repository into /etc/systemd/system/:) Tj
1 0 0 1 70.00 437.00 Tm
(- systemd/acw-display.service) Tj
1 0 0 1 70.00 421.00 Tm
(- systemd/acw-refresh.service) Tj
1 0 0 1 70.00 405.00 Tm
(- systemd/acw-refresh.timer) Tj
1 0 0 1 54.00 389.00 Tm
(Then enable them:) Tj
/F3 10.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 373.00 Tm
(sudo systemctl daemon-reload) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 359.00 Tm
(sudo systemctl enable --now acw-display.service) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 345.00 Tm
(sudo systemctl enable --now acw-refresh.timer) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 331.00 Tm
(Check service status:) Tj
/F3 10.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 315.00 Tm
(sudo systemctl status acw-display.service) Tj
1 0 0 1 72.00 301.00 Tm
(sudo systemctl status acw-refresh.timer) Tj
/F1 8.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 287.00 Tm
() Tj
/F2 15.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 277.00 Tm
(4. Create the kiosk launcher script) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.00 256.00 Tm
(Create this file on the Pi:) Tj
/F3 10.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 240.00 Tm
(/opt/acw-screen-updater/scripts/start-kiosk.sh) Tj
/F3 9.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 226.00 Tm
(#!/bin/bash) Tj
1 0 0 1 76.00 213.00 Tm
(set -e) Tj
1 0 0 1 76.00 200.00 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 76.00 187.00 Tm
(export DISPLAY=:0) Tj
1 0 0 1 76.00 174.00 Tm
(export XAUTHORITY=/home/pi/.Xauthority) Tj
1 0 0 1 76.00 161.00 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 76.00 148.00 Tm
(xset s off) Tj
1 0 0 1 76.00 135.00 Tm
(xset -dpms) Tj
1 0 0 1 76.00 122.00 Tm
(xset s noblank) Tj
1 0 0 1 76.00 109.00 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 76.00 96.00 Tm
(chromium-browser \\) Tj
1 0 0 1 76.00 83.00 Tm
(  --kiosk \\) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 471.00 28.00 Tm
(Page 1 of 3) Tj
ET
