/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 70.00 475.00 Tm
(- If your Pi username is not pi, change /home/pi/.Xauthority and the autostart) Tj
1 0 0 1 70.00 459.00 Tm
(  path to match your real home folder.) Tj
1 0 0 1 70.00 443.00 Tm
